 sırf taabbüd ve terbiye hıkmetiyle men-u tahrim edilenler vardır ki buna da sûrenin başında « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"211\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 210.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 3.0 9.7 9.7 17.3 17.3 38.3 38.3 47.3 47.3 54.0 54.0 60.7 67.6 84.7 84.7 93.7 93.7 100.6 100.6 114.7 122.3 138.0 149.3 149.3 149.3 156.0 156.0 168.7 168.7 184.6 192.0 192.0 198.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"60.7 67.6 100.6 184.6 198.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » kaydiyle işaret buyurulmuş idi. Şimdi buna celbi dikkatle buyuruluyor ki: <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"444\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 443.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 12.0 12.0 18.7 18.7 33.0 40.6 56.3 66.7 66.7 82.6 82.6 89.3 89.3 100.6 112.6 112.6 128.3 128.3 135.0 135.0 135.0 141.7 149.3 165.0 165.0 174.0 174.0 186.0 186.0 192.7 201.0 201.0 207.7 207.7 214.6 221.3 237.7 244.6 252.7 252.7 259.6 266.3 266.3 282.0 292.6 299.3 299.3 308.3 308.3 315.7 331.6 338.3 346.6 346.6 346.6 353.3 369.0 369.0 375.7 391.6 405.0 416.3\" y=\"25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"18.7 56.3 100.6 186.0 192.7 214.6 221.3 259.6 282.0 308.3 338.3 353.3 375.7 427.6\" y=\"20.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg></p>"}